Chapter: LinearFreeze
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 `freeze` consumes a linearly owned value and returns it as an ordinary
 immutable value. Here the linear parameter is consumed exactly once by
 freeze; the immutable result may then be used freely.

Section: Definitions

  finalize : linear Integer -> Integer
  finalize (n) = freeze n

  opening : Integer
  opening = finalize 21

